<title>NETHERLANDS: Volker Stevin plans share split.</title>
<headline>Volker Stevin plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch construction firm Volker Stevin NV said on Friday it planned a four for one share split.  </p>
<p>The company said in a brief statement it would propose the move at a general shareholders meeting on May 7.</p>
<p>Volker Stevin shares closed on Friday up 1.50 guilders at 183.50 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
